cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use IR-Toolbox, please cite it as below."
title: "IR-Toolbox — جعبه ابزار آفلاین فارسی"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source (MIT), offline-first Progressive Web App with 52
  privacy-first Persian (Farsi) web tools in 9 categories: text, developer,
  design, files, math, time and Jalali calendar, security (AES-256-GCM vault,
  password manager), fun and brain games. Everything runs 100% locally in the
  browser — no server, no database, no tracking.
authors:
